# Public-source allowlist: every file below has an explicit publication entry.
# New source, tests and docs stay private until added deliberately.
# Research, local QA/lab tools, captures, other authors' assets and downloads stay local.
# Run python3 tools/check_public_files.py before publishing. Do not force-add private files.
